abstract: >-
  R code for the primary UK Biobank Cox proportional hazards analyses of
  individualised sleep-anchored MVPA timing, including prospective follow-up
  construction, multiple imputation by chained equations, four progressively
  adjusted models, quintile exposure models, continuous per-hour exposure
  models, and Rubin pooling.
